{"text": " What if you were trapped 4km inside a flooded cave? June 23rd, 2018, Thailand Twelve boys from a football team and their coach walk into Tam Luang cave after practice. Then the monsoon rain comes early. The water rises behind them and the way out is gone. For nine days nobody knows if they're alive. Thousands of volunteers pump water and search the mountain. Then, two British divers surface in a dark chamber and start counting. 13. All Alive But the way out is hours of diving through black, narrow tunnels, and the boys can't swim it. Saman Kunan, a former Navy SEAL, runs out of air carrying tanks in and dies. So they try a wild plan. A doctor puts each boy to sleep, in a wetsuit and a full face mask, and divers carry them out one by one. 4 boys, then 4 more, then the last 4 and their coach. All 13 came out alive. Subscribe for more rescues.", "words": [{"word": "What", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.24}, {"word": "if", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.42}, {"word": "you", "start": 0.42, "end": 0.58}, {"word": "were", "start": 0.58, "end": 0.72}, {"word": "trapped", "start": 0.72, "end": 1.04}, {"word": "4km", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.88}, {"word": "inside", "start": 1.88, "end": 2.56}, {"word": "a", "start": 2.56, "end": 2.76}, {"word": "flooded", "start": 2.76, "end": 3.06}, {"word": "cave?", "start": 3.06, "end": 3.56}, {"word": "June", "start": 4.54, "end": 4.64}, {"word": "23rd,", "start": 4.64, "end": 5.62}, {"word": "2018,", "start": 5.74, "end": 6.36}, {"word": "Thailand", "start": 6.92, "end": 7.4}, {"word": "Twelve", "start": 7.95, "end": 8.3}, {"word": "boys", "start": 8.3, "end": 8.76}, {"word": "from", "start": 8.76, "end": 9.0}, {"word": "a", "start": 9.0, "end": 9.14}, {"word": "football", "start": 9.14, "end": 9.36}, {"word": "team", "start": 9.36, "end": 9.8}, {"word": "and", "start": 9.8, "end": 10.04}, {"word": "their", "start": 10.04, "end": 10.26}, {"word": "coach", "start": 10.26, "end": 10.62}, {"word": "walk", "start": 10.62, "end": 11.1}, {"word": "